<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>Think about what it means when x intervals overlap at a certain point in=
 time. This means at this point, there are x =E2=80=9C<strong>active</stron=
g>=E2=80=9D intervals, where an interval is active if it has started but no=
t ended.</p>
<p>In the example below, we see three active intervals at time 5 (intervals=
 that started at or before this time, and haven=E2=80=99t yet ended):</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
